      "content_digest_status": "not_snapshotted",
      "notes": "Reports ministerial remarks: Johannesburg NRW about 49%, including physical losses of 26%; also gives national and sector policy targets. Report does not state the underlying measurement period or reproduce the underlying water-balance worksheet."
