      "source_class": "official_utility_operational_statement",
      "content_digest_status": "not_snapshotted",
      "notes": "Reports high demand and excessive draw-off limiting reservoir and tower recovery, low pressure, intermittent supply and prolonged outages across named supply systems. It describes network reconfiguration, targeted throttling, leak detection and repairs as interventions; it is not an independently audited outcome evaluation."
    },
